  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rosevcook/heart_crystals/main/src/main/resources/logo.png\" width=\"1142\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblueprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://tinyurl.com/ycyjpbeb&n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Blueprint\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6uRtghgWnE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/780149719611473930?color=E2005C&label= &labelColor=AA0021&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/rosevcook/heart_crystals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-Team_Galena?label=&color=E2005C&labelColor=AA0021&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Github\"></a></p>\n<h3>📖 关于：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Heart Crystals 是一款受《泰拉瑞亚》启发的模组，会在地下添加稀有的心形水晶供你探索发现。使用这些水晶将永久为你增加一颗心。</li>\n<li>你将在一个新世界中以 5 颗心开始冒险，并可以逐步提升至最多 20 颗心。这两个数值均可完全自定义。</li>\n<li>心形水晶还可以被制作成各种物品，例如心形灯笼、丘比特之箭、再生药水，并可作为盔甲纹饰材料使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>📖 跨模组内容：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a> - 心形灯笼合成配方将包含银锭，并提供使用心形水晶碎片制作活体肉块的全新替代配方</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgallery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gallery</a> - 心跳画作的物品纹理</li>\n</ul>",
